---
import PlatformLayout from '../../layouts/PlatformLayout.astro';
---

<PlatformLayout title="About - Minhaajulhudaa Travels" platform="travels">
  <section class="container-app py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <span class="badge badge-accent mb-4">About Us</span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6">About Minhaajulhudaa Travels & Tours</h1>
    <p class="text-lg mb-8" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Your trusted partner for sacred journeys since 2023.</p>

    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Minhaajulhudaa Travels & Tours was established in 2023 to provide Muslims with seamless, spiritually fulfilling Hajj and Umrah experiences. We are a licensed travel agency specializing in Islamic tourism, with a commitment to making the sacred journeys accessible, affordable, and meaningful.</p>

    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Our team includes experienced Hajj and Umrah guides who have performed the pilgrimage multiple times. We handle every aspect of your journey - from visa processing and flight bookings to accommodation, transportation, and guided tours of the holy sites.</p>

    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-8" style="color: var(--color-muted);">We also offer local and international Islamic tours to historical sites, Islamic landmarks, and Muslim-friendly destinations. Our pre-travel education program ensures that every pilgrim is spiritually and practically prepared for their sacred journey.</p>

    <!-- Why Choose Us -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Why Choose Us?</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="card p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg mb-3 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: rgb(5,179,77,0.1);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--color-primary);"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Licensed & Trusted</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Officially licensed travel agency with years of experience in Hajj and Umrah services.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg mb-3 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: rgb(242,185,28,0.15);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--color-accent);"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Expert Guides</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Experienced scholars and guides who accompany every group to ensure a meaningful journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg mb-3 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: rgb(5,179,77,0.1);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--color-primary);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">24/7 Support</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Round-the-clock support throughout your journey. We are always just a call away.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg mb-3 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: rgb(242,185,28,0.15);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--color-accent);"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Complete Packages</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">All-inclusive packages covering visa, flights, hotels, transport, and guided tours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PlatformLayout>
